<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 850 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 850 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 850 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.7 BLN    1.7 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    400 MLN!   850 MLN!!  =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 400 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON OCT 21 &amp; 22 AT 5-23/32 PCT</p>
<p>!! INCLUDES 850 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON OCT 21 &amp; 22 AT 5-23/32 PCT  (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
